raw subpiece notation `IDENT._N_M_` = access the M-byte field at byte-offset N of IDENT. Convert to a
byte-addressed cast: `(*(T*)((char*)&IDENT + N))` with T by width (1->uchar,2->ushort,4->uint). Mechanical
